add('Task 3.1 · Frequency selection improves five-gas inference',body=['A deterministic coordinate-exchange screen selected sixteen blocks using the standard 45° design case.','The selection optimized the worst relative gas uncertainty while retaining PM and nuisance parameters. Exact tone spectra followed the coarse screen.'],table=[['CH₃CN at 1 µg/m³','Uniform bands','Selected bands'],['Simulated recall',f'{old:.2f}%',f'{new:.2f}%'],['Total acquisition time','20 s','20 s'],['Assumed residual standard deviation','0.0001 dB','0.0001 dB']],widths=[600,268,268],result='All five exact VOC information limits improve relative to the uniform design.',limit='January weather and response draws did not choose bands. Global optimality and unknown-weather robustness remain unproved.',notes=BASE+'. The fresh uniform control is 57.40%. The historical 56.63% value belongs to an earlier independent simulation. The selected result is a conditional improvement at equal resources.',sources=[CURRENT,'results/joint_receiver_revision/selection.json'])
add('Task 3.2 · Payload moments estimate signal and noise',body=['Used the existing constant-modulus QPSK payload instead of discarding most samples and retaining only 30 pilots per 10,000 symbols.','Applied the established M2M4 estimator with a finite-sample correction, then compared sample and reference powers.'],formula='M₂ = S + V       M₄ = S² + 4SV + 2V²\nS = √(2M₂² − M₄)       A = −10 log₁₀(Ssample / Sreference)',explain='S is received signal power. V is noise power. The moments separate signal and noise under the QPSK and Gaussian-noise model.',result='More existing symbols contribute information without adding sensing transmissions.',limit='Arbitrary QAM, nonlinear distortion or severe intercarrier interference invalidate these simple moments.',notes='M2M4 is established prior work. The contribution is its application, resource accounting and conditional evaluation here. Invalid inversions count as failures. Large experiments use the joint asymptotic distribution of second/fourth sample moments and nonlinear inversion. Raw QPSK controls independently test bounded cases.',sources=[GUIDE,'docs/42_payload_recall.md','https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.15998',PAPER])
